    `docker rm -f ${shq(containerName)} >/dev/null 2>&1`,
    // Clear CONTENTS, not the directory itself — preserves ownership/perms a
    // family's own setupScript may have already `chown`ed (e.g. Conan/The
    // Isle), and the fresh setup script's own `mkdir -p` (where present)
